WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:28.776
Tom was worried.

2
00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:32.085
The princess was very sick.

3
00:00:32.086 --> 00:00:36.875
Everyone was waiting for news from the royal doctor.

4
00:00:36.876 --> 00:00:40.397
At last the doctor came into the Throne Room.

5
00:00:40.398 --> 00:00:43.565
"How is she?" cried the queen.

6
00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:47.214
"Will the princess be okay?" the king asked.

7
00:00:47.215 --> 00:00:48.779
The doctor nodded.

8
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.898
"The princess can be cured."

9
00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:54.709
The queen touched her heart.

10
00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:57.643
"Oh, thank heavens!"

11
00:00:57.644 --> 00:01:00.706
"But . . . ," the doctor went on.

12
00:01:00.707 --> 00:01:04.645
"The princess must have something."

13
00:01:04.646 --> 00:01:08.946
"What?" Dirk snapped. "Anything!"

14
00:01:08.947 --> 00:01:10.394
"I'm afraid . . ."

15
00:01:10.395 --> 00:01:14.590
The doctor bowed his head.

16
00:01:14.591 --> 00:01:19.600
"The princess needs the juice of sweet pinkberries."

17
00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:22.425
The queen burst into tears.

18
00:01:22.426 --> 00:01:30.026
"But pinkberries only grow in the spring!"

19
00:01:30.027 --> 00:01:33.313
The king frowned.

20
00:01:33.314 --> 00:01:37.768
"We must be able to do something now!"

21
00:01:37.769 --> 00:01:41.419
"This is awful," Tom thought.

22
00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.086
Just then someone grabbed his arm.

23
00:01:44.087 --> 00:01:45.962
It was Dirk.

24
00:01:45.963 --> 00:01:49.992
He dragged Tom in front of the king and queen.

25
00:01:49.993 --> 00:01:54.321
"Our royal wizard can fix this!" said Dirk.

26
00:01:54.322 --> 00:01:57.453
"He can make a pinkberry bush appear!”

27
00:01:57.454 --> 00:02:00.909
"Er . . ." Tom gulped.

28
00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.434
"Sure, I can."

29
00:02:03.435 --> 00:02:11.014
Everyone cheered.

30
00:02:11.015 --> 00:02:20.155
The queen stopped crying.

31
00:02:20.156 --> 00:02:23.418
Everyone looked at Tom.

32
00:02:23.419 --> 00:02:28.519
But Tom just stood there.

33
00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.967
Dirk glared at Tom.

34
00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:33.665
"What are you waiting for?

35
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:39.579
The princess needs pinkberries at once!"

36
00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.492
Tom's face was bright red.

37
00:02:42.493 --> 00:02:53.015
"I forgot my wand," he said.

38
00:02:53.016 --> 00:03:00.755
Everyone groaned.
